  "sections": [
    {
      "block_id": "h1-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Rig Relay Versioning Policy",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Independent Version Line",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rig Relay has an **independent version line** derived from Mistral Vibe CLI lineage but versioned independently. Upstream Vibe CLI version numbers are **provenance only** — they do not determine Rig Relay's version.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-4",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Context",
        "Version"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Human/product version",
          "**v0.1.0-alpha.1**"
        ],
        [
          "Python package version (PEP 440)",
          "**0.1.0a1**"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Version Format",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- **Human**: SemVer-style wording: `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH-<pre-release>` Example: `v0.1.0-alpha.1` - **Python**: PEP 440-compatible: `<major>.<minor>.<patch><pre>` Example: `0.1.0a1`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Pre-release Convention",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-8",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Suffix",
        "Meaning"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`a1`, `a2`, `a3`",
          "Alpha releases — unstable API, schema, CLI changes allowed"
        ],
        [
          "`b1`, `b2`",
          "Beta releases — API/schema freeze preparation"
        ],
        [
          "(none)",
          "Stable release — public API/CLI/schema contracts stable"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What Version Bumps Mean",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-10",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Bump",
        "Meaning"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Patch (0.1.0 → 0.1.1)",
          "Bug fixes, tests, docs, safety fixes"
        ],
        [
          "Minor (0.1.0 → 0.2.0)",
          "New orchestration capability, feature additions"
        ],
        [
          "Major (0.y.z → 1.0.0)",
          "Stable CLI/data contracts for external users"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Current Release",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Rig Relay v0.1.0-alpha.1** (Python package `0.1.0a1`)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This is the first alpha release. It includes: - Local guarded runtime with dirty-file preservation - Coordination store and tool - Checkpoint commits - Normalized event streams - Dataset exporter, report, and inspector - Reviewer cockpit, spawn planner, current_state pulse - Queue planner - Telemetry/data-sharing doctrine - Semantic change snippet anonymizer",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Alpha Stability Guarantee",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "During the 0.y.z phase: - CLI flags may change. - JSON Schema fields may be added, removed, or renamed. - Runtime behavior may change. - Data formats may change. - No backward compatibility guarantees.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-16",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Provenance",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rig Relay began as a Vibe-derived fork but now uses an independent version line. Upstream compatibility is not guaranteed. The `vibe` module namespace is retained for internal organizational purposes during alpha. The legacy migration to `rig_relay.*` follows a Strangler Fig pattern. See `docs/governance/vibe-legacy-deprecation.md` for the migration doctrine. Existing `vibe.*` imports remain supported during alpha. New product code targets `rig_relay.*`. future release.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Version Source of Truth",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The canonical version is defined in two places that MUST match:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. `pyproject.toml`: `version = \"0.1.0a1\"` — Python packaging source 2. `vibe/__init__.py`: `__version__ = \"0.1.0a1\"` — runtime access",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Both must be updated together on every release.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
